// # openOODA CLI Docs — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: ASD-STE100 process docs for the cli/ driver.
//
// Setup: One .oot file per spec (argv, install, fix, fmt, context, token). All <= 256 lines.
//
// Beats:
//   1. argv.oot — argument grammar and error codes.
//   2. install.oot — XDG pack install protocol.
//   3. fix.oot — fix kinds, classifier, and 8-round loop.
//   4. fmt.oot — formatter invariants and idempotence.
//
// Specs are .oot siblings; they are not .oo modules. Do not import them.
